{"id":"cabinet:gem+gemr","view34":"PASS","quality":"PASS","reason":"Top wood plane (rows 2-5) and shelf planks read in 3/4, and the purple/cyan crystal clusters and cut gems have clean upper-left facet ramps and dark material outlines."}
